;;;; Philippines: what each year's proclamations change against the statutory
;;;; days of philippines-holidays-calendar (EO 292 Book I s. 26 as amended by RA
;;;; 9177, 9256, 9492, 9849 and 10966). :HOLIDAYS are the proclaimed days the rules
;;;; do not give (special non-working days, Eid'l Fitr and Eid'l Adha, moved days,
;;;; nationwide ad-hoc days); :SUPPRESSED are statutory dates not kept that year
;;;; (moved to a Monday, made a working day). Texts: lawphil.net (Official Gazette
;;;; via Wayback for Proc. 556 s.2018). Coverage: 2000-2027 (2027: Proc. 1427
;;;; s.2026; its Eid days are not proclaimed yet).

